    "title": "Fairdale blasts Knights 44-27 in home opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Doug Thomas ,\n23 hours ago Louisville Fairdale raced out to a 22-0 lead and defeated Marion County 44-27 on Saturday at John J. Boswell Field. The loss dropped the Knights to 0-2 on the season, but according to Head Football Coach Ross Brown there was noticeable improvement in his team’s effort against an even better opponent. Read full article\n2",
